      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I'm specifically looking for how these scholars address the idea of \"cultural bias\"—the argument that these tests don't measure intelligence so much as they measure familiarity with dominant cultural norms. Can you expand on that, and maybe touch on how that undermines the idea of a \"fair\" competition?",
